    "Each song becomes a card. The year comes from Apple Music, which sometimes has the date of a remaster or compilation, so check the songs before printing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jeder Song wird zu einer Karte. Das Jahr kommt von Apple Music, wo manchmal das Datum eines Remasters oder einer Compilation steht. Prüfe die Songs also vor dem Drucken."
          }
        }
      }
    },
